cff-version: 1.2.1
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "scgraph: Graph Engineering for Software Supply-Chain Impact Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A local pipeline over the open-source dependency graph. It uses zero LLM calls to
  build the graph. It tells if a project is exposed to a vulnerability, through which
  dependency path, and which fix is safe. If it cannot support an alert with a
  resolvable path, it abstains. Validated on 4.46 million packages, 21.4 million
  versions, and 82.8 million resolved dependency edges across eight ecosystems.
type: software
